# What never belongs in the image.
#
# The two big ones are node_modules and .venv: both are rebuilt inside the image for the
# right platform, and copying a macOS arm64 virtual environment into a Linux container
# produces a build that appears to work until something loads a compiled wheel.

.git
.gitignore
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

client/node_modules
client/dist

server/.venv
server/var
server/.env
server/.env.*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/htmlcov
**/.coverage

.claude
docs
*.md
!README.md
